Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,YUMMY Y
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Surveillance sensors, can you confirm the\Nlocation of the Kaiba Corporation airship?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Craft 3 is currently 1.4 miles\Nfrom our present coordinates. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin ascent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate rear engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Propulsion control, full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finally reclaim everything\Nyou've stolen from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our final destination is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand by for descent\Nupon Kaimakorp Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,for the conclusion of\Nthe Battle City Final.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep at all last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything that happened yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it's pretty obvious that\NMerrick will stop at nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,to get his hands on the\Nancient power of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.89,0:02:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll crush whoever stands in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you've done with Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you mean the Spirit of the Ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you should know what fate befalls someone\Nunfortunate enough to lose a Shadow King.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But Bakura was only one of Merrick's\Nvictims, and the list is growing fast. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's servant, Odeon, took the fall\Nwhen Merrick angered the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Merrick trapped Mai's\Nmind in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling who he'll target next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not just gonna sit\Naround and wait to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's gotta be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We appear to be bearing on course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we better bear back on\Ncourse before my brother finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying, but it's not going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, we've lost control, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The blimp is changing\Ndirection on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the autopilot was reprogrammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Programmed. Then shut it down and\Ndo it right now. What's up with the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,turbulence yeah some of us sleep past
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,five it appears someone else has an
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,interest in bringing chaos and misery\Nupon these fools as well what an
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:04:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,unexpected and amusing turn of offense\Noh no the autopilot isn't responding Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's rejecting every\None of my commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I pay you good money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do whatever it takes to get us\Nback on course to Kaiba Corp Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That pile of junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch what you're calling junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.77,0:04:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where our company starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the final dueling site?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I built it from the ruins\Nof my stepfather's empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It symbolizes the triumph of new over old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp wasn't always a game company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The corporation was\Noriginally set up by our
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,stepdad to construct\Nhigh-tech vehicles for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But then Seto took over\Nand changed all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That island out there used to be\Nthe company's central headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,until my brother tore down\Nall the military factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he built that dual\Ntower on top of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,rubble as a symbol of the new Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:05:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we hit a sore spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened between me and my\Nstepfather is family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's all ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I command an empire that dwarfs his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I'm crowned the world's\Ngreatest duelist on top of that tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be free from my\Nstepfather's shadow forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our navigation computers are taking\Ncommands from outside the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's hacked into the mainframe and\Nchanged our destination coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The security system on this\Nship is state of the art.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Our situation is worsening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing altitude rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, you buffoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean besides the whiplash\Nand the sprained ankle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you say, lawsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Try the emergency override system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been completely locked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who's behind all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't let my\Ntriumphant return to Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Corp Island be ruined\Nby some computer geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong\Nwith your television set.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in control now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself, always\Nbarking orders, aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you i've been observing\Nyou and it's time i put
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you in your place seto\Nso from now on i'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,calling the shots around\Nhere and my first order
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,of business is to put an\Nend to your little card
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,game you'll never get\Naway with this you creep
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,too late for that i\Nalready have look kid i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,demand to know your name\Nthere you go again Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Noah, and you and I go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a long way, Seto. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of your foolish games.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my games have\Nonly just begun, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he meant by that, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I think\Nwe're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like some kind of\Nunderwater fortress or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the looks of it. It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's still growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I have bad news, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Well, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,it appears that floating\Nfortress is using a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,tractor beam to pull\Nour aircraft towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you little brat, enough's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid has us right where he wants us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish I knew where that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's activated our landing function, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.63,0:07:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be even more\Ninteresting than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we land, I'll\Nmake that little brat pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want first crack at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, he's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we are, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my aircraft and\NI'll handle this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,my own whatever I have\Na feeling there's more
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to that kid Noah than\Nmeets the eye there's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,no way some prefubescent\Npunk planned all this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for dropping in,\NZeto. Time for you and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,your friends to exit\Nthe ship is Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid at this point,\Nrefusal is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my stun phasers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You all stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is my battle, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't do me any favors. Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, you are not to leave this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, I'll be coming out to\Nyou alone. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to reconsider your decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can answer that for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's try this whole\Nthing again, shall we, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be so kind as to exit\Nthe ship with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this, and\Nwe'll be out of here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what this kid's beef is\Nwith you, But it's our problem now, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so why don't you just get over yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll all proceed straight\Nahead, we can continue this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kainer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You two goons can wait on the blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This invitation is for duelists only.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has to know that,\Nso zip it, Dice Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, I want you to stay\Nright here, where it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, we're a team, and there's no way\NI'm letting you go out there without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's better off with us, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That creep Merrick is\Nback there, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a great deal of\Nturmoil and destruction ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the enemy of\Nmy enemy is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.39,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you want from us, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be made clear soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just continue to the end of the hallway\Nwhere my associates will greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're especially excited\Nto see you, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting creepier and creepier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks too big to be\Na racquetball court.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.99,0:11:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have known we'd be\Nback, Seto Kaiba, for revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised to see us again, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know these five suits, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I feel really underdressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't put my finger on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but something about these guys\Nseems really familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the five creeps that tried to\Nget rid of Seto and take over Kaiba Corp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gansley, Crump, Johnson, Nesbitt and\NLector, also known as the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They trapped Kyber in\NCyberland until we saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They were hired by my stepfather to\Nserve as Kyber Corp's board of directors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But that wasn't enough power for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So they tried to destroy me using my own
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual technology and\Ntake over my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eto, it's not your regular\Nattack hacking, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you slimeballs, it's over. Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it's you five who will be\Ntrapped here when I fuse together
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my three monsters to form\NBlue-Eye's Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eye's Ultimate Dragon, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with Black Bluster Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When those corporate Creepazoids lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,they were imprisoned in the\Nvirtual world instead of Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But did you honestly believe\Nthat you'd seen the last of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We wandered through cyberspace\Nfor what seemed like an eternity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking of one question over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we get revenge\Nfor our suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:13:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally found our answer the day that\NNoah hacked into Kaiba Corpse mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we discovered that we all\Nshared a common enemy in Seto Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,naturally Noah uploaded\Nour minds to his system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys are virtual?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated you once, and\NI can easily do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We plan to give you every\Nopportunity to do so, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, for we've devised a\Nnew game with Noah's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of a game are we\Ntalking about, you snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a game you're quite\Nfamiliar with, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a duel monsters tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A virtual duel monsters\Ntournament, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're all invited to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you guys want to duel us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds have been trapped in\Nthis virtual prison for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,we've lost our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we defeat you in\NNoah's virtual arena,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll return to the\Nreal world in your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's taking over my body again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to pay a visit\Nto our special dueling world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll find this world\Nunlike anything you've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a jungle. Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a jungle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you geeks listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This environment is virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this place looks real, but it's\Nactually just a life-size video game, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.55,0:14:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure this isn't real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it sure smells real. That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, that's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of this, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't I see you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kaiba! Digital!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat Noah can't intimidate me\Nwith cheap virtual illusions like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I rode better virtual reality programs back\Nwhen this kid was still wearing diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff's amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just change your\Noutfit or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's not Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You, he, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's a cheap copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to create virtual clones of\Nmyself all the time to duel against.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why duel yourself? Who better?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:16:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to demonstrate\Nthe new dueling rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, new rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.01,0:16:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We've created a new system of dueling,\Nespecially for our tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So pay attention and try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In our world, we play by a new set of\Nrules called the Deck Master System.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch and learn as our virtual\NKaiba battles total defense show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First, each duelist must\Nchoose a Deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes will be Virtual Kaibas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Total Defense Shogun will act as\Nhis own Deckmaster. Now, begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,For my first move, I\Nsummon Lord of Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I activate the\NFlute of Summoning Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to summon two\Nmore Blue-Eyes White Dragons to the playing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll move my Deck Master\Nto the center of the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Saiba Kaiba played three\NBlue-Eyes in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So it looks like your\NDeck Master stands next to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you until you decide to\Nsummon it to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, I'll use Polymerization to fuse\Nmy three Blue-Eyes White Dragons together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To form Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtual Kaiba combined his\NDeckmaster with two other
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes to form a creature\Nthat's virtually unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to his\NDeckmaster Special Ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,this new Fusion Monster\Ncan attack immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.87,0:17:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon, I command you\Nto attack Total Defense Shogun directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,since Total Defense Shogun is also a\NDeckmaster, it has its own Special Ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Total Defense Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It blocks the attack, and\Nreflects it right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-ta, Virtual Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon that will happen to the real McCord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, if your Deckmaster is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you automatically lose the\Nduel regardless of life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And when each of you loses a duel,\None of us will take over your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've defeated you five\Nwhite-collar has-beens once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can easily do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what the rules are,\NI'll still take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us out of here, you\Ncrotchety old pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never even left\Nthis room, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But make no mistake, you kids aren't\Ngoing anywhere for a long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.07,0:19:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and your only chance of escape is to\Ndefeat each of us in a virtual duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're going to get\Naway with this, you stuffed shirts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.44,0:19:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kick your big\Nbusiness butts! Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can whip these five\Ngeezers one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise we'll win, and I've\Nnever broken a promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then promise you'll be careful. Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stick together,\Nthey won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I got your back, man. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass the jam, because these guys are pups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They never said which of us\Nwill actually have to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make sure that\Nyou all suffer equally,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be dueling against\Nevery one of you, brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we need to\Ntake over five bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.71,0:20:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So the first five of you\Nto lose will have the honor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of gaining our minds while\Nyours stay trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.51,0:20:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you destroyed our bodies,\Nall we've had are our dreams, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.87,0:20:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.37,0:20:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to make our dreams\Na reality by escaping from this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.03,0:20:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual abyss and leaving you here\Nin our place for all eternity.
